          "name": "Mint a signed URL for a direct JSONL upload",
          "request": {
            "name": "Mint a signed URL for a direct JSONL upload",
            "description": {
              "content": "For browser clients that upload the file straight to storage instead of through the API: returns a file id and a signed PUT URL (valid 15 minutes). After the PUT succeeds, register the file with the complete call. CLI and SDK clients should use the plain upload instead.\n",
